WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.000
I actually so it started with me a

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.640
little bit about two months ago after we

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.559
played golf. I uh I realized that I'm

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.240
just hooked on my phone, man. I'm hooked

00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:11.599
on it. I'm addicted. It was It was

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.040
hurting my sleep. It was hurting my

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:14.480
relationships. It was hurting my, you

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.760
know, desire to get up and go do things

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.439
with my kids. And so for a week, I said,

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.039
"I'm going to turn my phone off at 7:00

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:22.880
p.m. I'm gonna turn it back on at 7

00:00:21.039 --> 00:00:25.119
a.m."

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.599
That was unbelievable hard. Unbelievably

00:00:25.119 --> 00:00:29.760
hard for me, Corey. It was very hard. I

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:31.039
would be anxious. I'd wake up and I'd

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.200
wake up at 6:00. Me and my wife always

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:36.079
have coffee from 6:00 to 7:00. 7:20 I

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.320
take the kids to school. Um, it was

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:40.559
uncomfortable and difficult and I

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:43.680
realized that I just could not keep up.

00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:45.200
I get 30 text messages a day. Text

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.719
messaging. Text messaging is the new

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.680
email. Like I could scroll through and

00:00:46.719 --> 00:00:49.200
show you. It's actually getting a lot

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.480
better. But I kind of made a commitment

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:54.879
to myself to like make it okay. Like be

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.079
hard to reach. It's okay. Like the

00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:57.840
people closest to you will understand.

00:00:56.079 --> 00:00:59.120
If they get upset, so be it. You can

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.239
still be respectful. You can still spend

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.399
good time with people. You can still

00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:04.879
show love and care. But every time

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:07.439
somebody sends you a note, a message,

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:08.960
you don't have to respond. Like the

00:01:07.439 --> 00:01:10.080
random text messages that you get, you

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.360
don't have to respond. You don't have to

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:14.159
jump to do this. You don't have to say

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.520
yes to every request. And that was

00:01:14.159 --> 00:01:17.360
really uncomfortable for me cuz I'm type

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:20.240
A. And it goes back to like us

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:22.080
scheduling this thing. Um [snorts]

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:25.119
I was just I I had a lot on my plate.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:27.840
Like I was busy. I had a lot going on.

00:01:25.119 --> 00:01:30.400
I was hard for you to reach. And I think

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.640
being at a little bit of peace with that

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:34.159
is difficult, but it helped me. And now

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:36.400
my screen time is down to like two and a

00:01:34.159 --> 00:01:38.960
half hours a day on my phone. I forget

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.640
it. I forget it in my truck. Some nights

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.520
I don't take it with me when I leave to

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:45.360
go run errands. Sometimes um I have so

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.200
much healthier relationship now with my

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:49.040
phone. Really encourage people to do

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.799
that because a lot of parenting as well

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.320
as kind of leading by example

00:01:50.799 --> 00:01:53.920
>> and that I struggle with that too. I

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.600
